Cell["\<\
Note that these will be in the Default normalization, even though the \
Amplitudes of the TeukolskyPointParticleMode are in UnitTransmission! This is \
a compromise between agreement to the numerics and computation time. \
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9551795594490557`*^9, 3.955179710074749*^9}, {
  3.955179749972155*^9, 3.9551797507994018`*^9}, {3.993746571191086*^9, 
